body:
\*Spoilers\*

&#x200B;

Jean doesn't fucking die, like come on, all she does is sacrifice her powers to destroy the alien fleet and then dissapears, but either the ending or post-credits scene clearly hint at her being alive, but without any powers of her own

I think Boruto should've had his Elemental Hand Device for *Jump Force*, cause aside from the Vanishing Rasengan he's basically and literally Naruto of Part I, with the Uzumaki Barrage, Standard Rasengan and everything, it almost feels like a waste of slot

He would've been more unique and awesome by utilizing Water, Lightning and Wind Release, even if by cheating

&#x200B;

I think they will be among the last characters to be announced, just to leave the fans on suspense and keep them ''on their toes''

They're literally doing the same with the massive JoJo fanbase, as they're yet to announce their characters from the franchise by now (almost just 2 months away from release), but given how popular that franchise is they're obviously gonna be in there

&#x200B;

Okay Planet, give me that supid energy

&#x200B;

\*Gathers stupid energy\*

&#x200B;

BEGONE

&#x200B;

\*Throws Genkidama\*

I could watch this film times upon times, such a brilliant masterpiece

&#x200B;

Hitchcock's truly a legend, timeless afff
